  "releaseNotes": "14.3.0 - Server-side thumbnail URL generation using IImageUrlGenerator. Thumbnail URLs are no longer constructed client-side.\n\n14.2.1 - Added support for SVG/vector files from the Mediaflow FileSelector.\n\n14.2.0 - Server-side OAuth token exchange. Credentials are no longer exposed to the browser.\n\n14.1.0 - Appsettings config, usage report fix, Delivery API support, translations. Supports all Umbraco 14.x versions.\n\n1.0 - Dotnet core version",
